    "synopsis": {
        "native": "Rattrap\u00e9 par ses souvenirs d\u2019enfance, un adolescent constate le foss\u00e9 affectif qui le s\u00e9pare de sa m\u00e8re qui n\u2019a jamais exprim\u00e9 de marque d\u2019affection envers lui. Plus proche de son p\u00e8re, il craint sa propre m\u00e8re qu\u2019il juge responsable du climat orageux au sein de sa famille. Il va progressivement se rendre compte que ses parents ne sont pas tout \u00e0 fait ceux qu\u2019il imaginait.",
        "english": "Caught up in his childhood memories, a young teenager is faced with an emotional gulf that separates him from his mother, who has never shown any affection toward him. Closer to his father, he fears his mother, whom he holds responsible for their stormy home life. Gradually, he will come to realize that his parents are not quite the people he thought they were."
